data: {"id": "e9f7bb071f024865-thinking-parallel_evidence-2009", "run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **当前状态**：Pod 为 `Pending`，容器 reason 为 `ContainerCreating`（PromQL 也确认 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，reason=\"ContainerCreating\"），未运行。\n2. **Events 错误原文**：\n   - `Warning NoNetworkFound: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)`\n   - `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox: plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add)`\n   - 具体错误链：`getKubernetesDelegate failed: network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavai", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789058422288, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e9f7bb071f024865-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "seq": 2010, "ts_ms": 1789058431603, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 47.898, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e9f7bb071f024865-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "94cc2ec4f65d5644a2e55e32bf8e8acd327dbeac2163684fdc81cab372b04481", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "4efb38b1a85aa9b31eab9d524031b9318ac2a6d72c7d2a76aac1115bffcd3605"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "e9f7bb071f024865-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "seq": 2011, "ts_ms": 1789058431604, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e9f7bb071f024865-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "seq": 2012, "ts_ms": 1789058441638, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.034, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1942, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh stuck in ContainerCreating phase |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = \"ContainerCreating\" | 确认 Pod 当前卡在前端状态，容器未启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` (fact-42d73004d0d0): `rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error loading k8s delegates ... getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接指出 kubelet 调用 Multus 创建网络时，因找不到定义的网络资源而失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (fact-010b07d1deaf): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 持续出现的警告事件，确认 Multus 插件在多个重试周期内均无法定位目标网络 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\" (fact-c4c16bab67f8) | 量化验证了 Pod 处于等待状态且未被调度至运行 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态是 kubelet 无法成功配置网络沙箱的直接结果。Kubernetes 事件记录显示，在 Pod 创建及多次重试过程中，Multus CNI 插件均因在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 而报错（`NoNetworkFound` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件）。这一配置缺失导致网络插件链中断，进而阻碍了容器的启动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找不到该定义 → Pod 网络沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → 容器保持 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的网络注解，但该网络资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n证据编号 2 和 3 明确指出 Multus 插件在尝试加载 k8s 委托网络时，因找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io` 资源而报错，进而导致 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh stuck in ContainerCreating phase |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = \"ContainerCreating\" | 确认 Pod 当前卡在前端状态，容器未启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` (fact-42d73004d0d0): `rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error loading k8s delegates ... getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接指出 kubelet 调用 Multus 创建网络时，因找不到定义的网络资源而失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (fact-010b07d1deaf): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 持续出现的警告事件，确认 Multus 插件在多个重试周期内均无法定位目标网络 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\" (fact-c4c16bab67f8) | 量化验证了 Pod 处于等待状态且未被调度至运行 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态是 kubelet 无法成功配置网络沙箱的直接结果。Kubernetes 事件记录显示，在 Pod 创建及多次重试过程中，Multus CNI 插件均因在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 而报错（`NoNetworkFound` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件）。这一配置缺失导致网络插件链中断，进而阻碍了容器的启动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找不到该定义 → Pod 网络沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → 容器保持 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的网络注解，但该网络资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n证据编号 2 和 3 明确指出 Multus 插件在尝试加载 k8s 委托网络时，因找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io` 资源而报错，进而导致 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "e9f7bb071f024865-final", "run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "seq": 2014, "ts_ms": 1789058441649, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh stuck in ContainerCreating phase |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = \"ContainerCreating\" | 确认 Pod 当前卡在前端状态，容器未启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` (fact-42d73004d0d0): `rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... error loading k8s delegates ... getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接指出 kubelet 调用 Multus 创建网络时，因找不到定义的网络资源而失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (fact-010b07d1deaf): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 持续出现的警告事件，确认 Multus 插件在多个重试周期内均无法定位目标网络 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\" (fact-c4c16bab67f8) | 量化验证了 Pod 处于等待状态且未被调度至运行 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态是 kubelet 无法成功配置网络沙箱的直接结果。Kubernetes 事件记录显示，在 Pod 创建及多次重试过程中，Multus CNI 插件均因在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 而报错（`NoNetworkFound` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件）。这一配置缺失导致网络插件链中断，进而阻碍了容器的启动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找不到该定义 → Pod 网络沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → 容器保持 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的网络注解，但该网络资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n证据编号 2 和 3 明确指出 Multus 插件在尝试加载 k8s 委托网络时，因找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io` 资源而报错，进而导致 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 31.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 47.9s (Evidence 38.6s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 89.515, "metrics": {"run_id": "e9f7bb071f024865", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 89.52094030380249, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": 